e's own header says to prove a limit on the pinned image\n  before committing one."],[3694,"no file carries an import block, a host name, or a dead metric shape"],[4345,"No flag, or `--dry-run`, is a plan: it opens no ssh session, starts no container, and\nprints what is configured plus the exact `docker run` lines `--apply` would ferry."],[5444,"No force-push, no rewritten shared history, no merging your own pull request."],[2820,"No GitHub PAT in Hermes. GitHub auth in this stack is Coder External Auth only, and a\ntoken here would sit on a container that can both write to the checkout and drive the\nhost daemon. See SECURITY.md."],[4390,"No group in `sparks.json` means no target, which means no `up` series, which means an\nempty panel rather than a red one - the symptom looks like \"nothing is wrong\" from\nGrafana."],[2310,"No guard exits non-zero on its own account, so a broken one cannot wedge a session."],[1386,"no heading may sit between the title and the pair"],[342,"No host `coder` CLI and no `coder login` are involved, and a stale host-side session\ncannot aim the push at some other deployment."],[4749,"No line at all is one of these:"],[3025,"No other probe reply strands anything: 429 and 408 are skipped at the call site by\n`health_check_ignore_transient_errors` (`proxy_server.py:4001-4004`), any other 4xx is\nrefused at `:248`, and a genuine 5xx clears the catch-all at `:252` only to fall through\nevery base-case arm."],[2243,"no other ready task sharing a path"],[5178,"No process can rewrite another process's environment, so the stale pair stays in the\nenvironment until the workspace restarts; the prefix is the permanent form, not a\nworkaround you graduate from."],[3229,"No Redis is configured for this proxy, so the marks live in one process\n(`router_utils/health_state_cache.py:32-36`) and every restart or redeploy clears\nthem until the first sweep finishes; the filter has no log line on any of its\nfail-open exits, so nothing proves that window h