>/SKILL.md` with a twin copy at\n`~/.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`, and a missing command means that seed is\nmissing, not that the image is stale."],[808,"So for most of a workspace's life the helper echoes a dead\ntoken, github.com answers `remote: Invalid username or token. Password authentication is\nnot supported for Git operations.`, and the healthy store beside it is never asked."],[4920,"So is the third reading this default creates, `10` over `15`:\nthe ceiling shrunk by an operator's `--var grok_swarm_width`, under a width that kept the\nvariable's own shipped `15`."],[4042,"So neither side can fail to *start* over a vault that is down. The workspace is the one that\nnever can: every path in the boot body, refusals included, exits 0 and the agent goes on with\nthe environment it already had."],[4679,"So no `allowed_fails` number and no `cooldown_time` cools a box that is simply gone --\nwhich is why `litellm/config.yaml` ships no `allowed_fails` key at all, and why\n`cooldown_time: 60` is there for the other failure: a box that answers HTTP and returns\nreal 5xx."],[1716,"So resolve the root from the environment first, then prove it, and fail loudly when the\nproof fails. `resolve_checkout` in `scripts/lib/common.sh` is that resolver and every CLI that\nreads a file the checkout alone holds calls it, so do not write a second one. It takes the calling\nscript's own directory as its last candidate and the marker to probe for (`docker-compose.yml` by\ndefault); the call site in every one of those CLIs is this:"],[1771,"so the card that opens Grafana Explore for Loki and Tempo opens the same Grafana the\ndatasources point at."],[497,"So the clone must exist at the same path inside the sidecar too, or it dies with\n`bind source path does not exist`."],[599,"So the create form's **Grok approval mode** is\n  the seam for that key, and an approval mode hand-written into the file does not\n  survive a re-render, while every other `[ui]` key the operator set still d