e. Six of them store and read - `prometheus`,\n`mimir`, `loki`, `tempo`, `grafana` and `alloy` - and four watch the box and speak up -\n`node_exporter`, `cadvisor`, `blackbox_exporter` and `alertmanager`. They answer one\nquestion the rest of the stack cannot - what this box was doing ten minutes ago - and they\nare the only part of the stack that keeps data after a container is gone. Everything else on this page is about the seams between them,\nbecause that is where a monitoring stack silently stops working: a service can be\n`running`, a dashboard can be green, and a panel can still be empty."],[3031,"TensorFold on the Spark boxes refuses an over-admitted stream with the Zig error value\n`NoRoom`, delivered as an HTTP 500 body."],[212,"Terminal and editor defaults"],[1886,"Terminal and editor defaults"],[228,"Terminal and editor defaults inside the container, and workspace GitHub credentials"],[2003,"Terminal and editor defaults, and the profile the templates seed"],[1560,"Terraform"],[5321,"Terraform / OpenTofu with ArgoCD"],[4515,"Terraform and the host `coder` CLI"],[1572,"Terraform: why a `variable` without a `type` is a runtime bug"],[1453,"test-with-bazel.md explains the suites those queries name\nand the two inventory gates; ../project-conventions.md\nthe CLI vocabulary this tool prints in"],[1635,"Testing with Bazel (the Bats harness)"],[1637,"Testing with Bazel (the Bats harness)"],[4078,"Tests"],[4111,"Tests are hermetic: docker, ssh, curl, git and the other external tools resolve through\n`tests/bats/tool_stubs`."],[1030,"That\nfallback is what the \"Agent backend\" card exists to catch - Grok Build, Cline and\nRoo need structured tool calls, which the Arc IPEX-LLM Ollama returns as plain text\nfor the Qwen2.5-Coder weights."],[4957,"That `15` is the variable's own shipped default, and the shipped recipe makes it the\nfleet's ceiling too - 3 Spark boxes x `PARALLEL` 5 (`scripts/spark-configure.sh:92`) - so\nthe two numbers agree only while nobody shrin